{"v":4,"catch":"攀登、探索、發現。","desc":"這是一場寧靜而又充滿挑戰的冒險，你將扮演一位勇敢的英雄，攀登一座神秘的山峰。旅程充滿了考驗：陡峭的懸崖、危險的穿越，以及意想不到的敵人，你必須運用技巧、策略和力量來擊敗它們。\n探索山峰的每一層，克服平台挑戰，並與阻擋你前進的敵人展開戰術戰鬥。隨著你的攀登，你將揭開山峰的秘密，並更接近你的終極目標——矗立在峰頂的古老生命之樹。","publisher":"CGI LAB GAMES","release":"2026-03-05","genres":["冒險","動作","模擬","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c42383188b00d4248bf67cddaff5c3ce05d572fc938ef2553f4f744a35cd860.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1d7bdd075c91dc1b4aaec08aca9e4c6e2e9bc7852607b1e88188a3f250389a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f21352eae839378e759061e3ad91d8d7c8faa96ea9292646f9297700828bbc3f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df73aba0b26f4419d3592134d6610418593c05a3bb4be8cdd6c59be2112536d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b492bfef70960bac97ec25594ccae40c6d883bd51d7ca813681436dd772c523.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/42d56d36facff77047c1f1355372c3ea6ea1e9c066e52cfb2612f6161b2ceadd.jpg"],"titleId":"01004fa02519e000","dlc":[]}